@QueueApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5087
@organizationId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@userId = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
@staffUserId = 33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333
@queueId = 10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@counterId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@busyCounterId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@ticketId = 40000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005

### List queues for Heilbronn University
GET {{QueueApi_HostAddress}}/api/queues?organizationId={{organizationId}}
Accept: application/json

### Registrar queue
GET {{QueueApi_HostAddress}}/api/queues/{{queueId}}
Accept: application/json

### Registrar counters
GET {{QueueApi_HostAddress}}/api/queues/{{queueId}}/counters
Accept: application/json

### Sam's active assignment
GET {{QueueApi_HostAddress}}/api/counter-assignments/active?staffUserId={{staffUserId}}
Accept: application/json

### Registrar tickets
GET {{QueueApi_HostAddress}}/api/queues/{{queueId}}/tickets
Accept: application/json

### Position of REG5
GET {{QueueApi_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/position
Accept: application/json

### Call next on Counter 1
POST {{QueueApi_HostAddress}}/api/counters/{{counterId}}/tickets/call-next
Accept: application/json

### Call next on Counter 2 while it is serving
POST {{QueueApi_HostAddress}}/api/counters/{{busyCounterId}}/tickets/call-next
Accept: application/json

### Daily counters
GET {{QueueApi_HostAddress}}/api/queues/{{queueId}}/daily-counters
Accept: application/json

###
